# Today's Daily on a phone held sideways (DPR 3): the Daily screen, the table, played out by finger (check or
# call from the tray, S skipping the AI) to the results.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 =Daily challenge
frames 60
touch =Daily challenge
until 300 Play today’s table
frames 10
save d-daily
touch =Play today’s table
until 600 Table status
until 900 =Fold
frames 60
save d-table
repeat 4000 until Breakdown
  key KeyS 1
  frames 3
  key KeyC 1
  frames 3
end
frames 60
save d-results
expect Result recorded for
